sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant API as NativeAuthEndpoints
    participant PR as PasswordResetFlowService
    participant NC as NativeAuthClient
    participant CIAM as Entra External ID (CIAM)

    U->>API: POST /password-reset/start {email}
    API->>PR: StartAsync(email)
    PR->>NC: resetpassword/v1.0/start
    NC->>CIAM: start
    CIAM-->>NC: continuation_token
    NC->>CIAM: resetpassword/v1.0/challenge (must be oob)
    CIAM-->>NC: OTP challenge sent to email
    NC-->>PR: OtpChallenge
    PR-->>API: OtpChallenge
    API-->>U: 200 OtpChallengeResponse

    U->>API: POST /password-reset/verify {continuationToken, code}
    API->>PR: VerifyCodeAsync(token, code)
    PR->>NC: resetpassword/v1.0/continue (grant_type=oob)
    NC->>CIAM: continue
    CIAM-->>NC: new continuation_token
    NC-->>PR: token
    PR-->>API: token
    API-->>U: 200 {continuationToken}

    U->>API: POST /password-reset/complete {continuationToken, newPassword}
    API->>PR: CompleteAsync(token, newPassword)
    PR->>NC: resetpassword/v1.0/submit {new_password}
    NC->>CIAM: submit
    CIAM-->>NC: polling continuation_token + interval

    loop poll until succeeded (max ~10 attempts, ~50s)
        PR->>NC: resetpassword/v1.0/poll_completion
        NC->>CIAM: poll_completion
        CIAM-->>NC: status: in_progress | succeeded
    end

    NC->>CIAM: oauth2/v2.0/token (grant_type=continuation_token)
    CIAM-->>NC: access_token, id_token, refresh_token
    NC-->>PR: tokens
    PR-->>API: tokens
    API-->>U: 200 AuthTokensResponse
